{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id105934632"}, "name":{"label":"gabrielcrowe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-23T09:08:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"1352294342"}, "title":{"label":"The only app that works for me"}, "content":{"label":"I'm useless at everyday things. I am a games developer and it consumes my life. This app gives me a regular pulse to run with and it has helped me immeasurably. Thank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id110130251"}, "name":{"label":"Princess_Misuzu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-22T12:42:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"1351860446"}, "title":{"label":"Lost a star as you're limited to 6 tasks!"}, "content":{"label":"From remembering to complete daily tasks, to goals (like drinking more water or getting more exercise)... This app is perfect. It makes you actually do the stuff you usually leave until tomorrow because you don't want to lose your streak! The only downside is that you can only set 6 tasks to complete with absolutely NO option to expand on this. I don't think it's the best move to take that choice away from people (especially if they have things to do on different days of the week!)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id100328581"}, "name":{"label":"Cazza-line"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-17T17:16:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"1349405156"}, "title":{"label":"Motivates and regulates"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great for people like me, who can't stick to an hour by hour timetable. The idea is that you can set targets to achieve (mine are all daily) and you can work towards them during the day however you please. Then every time you manage to achieve the target by the time you set, you build up your streak. The best thing, for me, is the flexibility compared to usual timetable type apps! \n\nBecause you're doing things daily, it also regulates your daily activities, which is a helpful bonus. \n\nI should mention though that I got this app free from a Starbucks card, so with that in consideration, I have no complaints!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id469549999"}, "name":{"label":"Zachoronius"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-17T11:55:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"1349313409"}, "title":{"label":"Great apps works well"}, "content":{"label":"It works really well and efficiently and also has a nice layout. Even if you forget to tick the box the day before you can tick it the day after. One annoying point is that you cannot add more than 6 things to do and you can't access the app from you're lock screen which therefore means that it takes quite a while to access the app if you're short on time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
