{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id275621410"}, "name":{"label":"Justnikkixx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-01-03T03:09:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"1310548442"}, "title":{"label":"Backtrack?"}, "content":{"label":"It's an awesome app. Really simple and easy to use.\nYou can use it to aim for daily tasks or set it for only certain days or number of days per week. An improvement would be the option of aiming for twice a day.\nIt would also be good if you could pull up a calendar and record for previous days so that if you've forgotten to log it but have done the task, then you don't lose your streak. Or be able to say 'my current streak is two days' when you create a new task. I understand that 6 is a good amount of habits for most people, and the option for too many would be overwhelming but I use it to track the most basic things (shower, clean teeth, etc) so having a few more would be good. Maybe 8 (4 rows of 2) or 9 (3 rows of 3) so that they still all fit on the same page.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id109996781"}, "name":{"label":"PThorny"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-12-20T08:06:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"1303473922"}, "title":{"label":"Simple as it needs to be"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using this app for 4 months now. It's not complicated and is perfect for motivating me to prioritise and monitor my daily habits. The new feature for tracking items by number of times per week is a welcome addition.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
