{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id100719556"}, "name":{"label":"EddMol"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-12-19T00:57:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"1302778188"}, "title":{"label":"Simple and very effective"}, "content":{"label":"This is a brilliant app, especially when used with the Apple Watch complication. It's a very simple and effective way of monitoring your daily habits and ensuring you get them done. Basically this app will improve your life. Not bad for a couple of quid! \n\nThe health kit integration works well, although I would like a bit more granularity in the goals you can set- eg being able to choose a target of 4500 steps rather than just 4000 or 5000. Also, the only frustration I have with the Apple Watch compilation is that it doesn't seem to auto update health data connected habits unless you open the iPhone app first. \n\nAs someone who likes to tinker, I'd like to be able to try out other habits to track without having to delete one of my six current habits (and all their historical data) first. \n\nAnd possibly I'd also like the ability to put habits on hold for a holiday. Maybe make it so that the minimum hold length is 5 days. I'm not expecting to go to bed on time, read every day, run every day, on my holiday, so I don't really want to feel bad about not completing them... But maybe this suggested hold period be too tempting for some people. \n\nLong story short it's excellent, and only a few minor minor things above would make it perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id184292125"}, "name":{"label":"robmckenzieuk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-12-19T00:29:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"1302768500"}, "title":{"label":"Love it!"}, "content":{"label":"I don't understand the reviews bemoaning the fact you can only track 6 habits, 6 at any one time is ample, any more and it weakens the apps strength. It has rapidly become a favourite app :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
