{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id266510202"}, "name":{"label":"Fuguui"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-10-13T10:35:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"1271122359"}, "title":{"label":"Daily habits enforcer"}, "content":{"label":"Although it is quite pricey, it really does help me to remind me to the little things I need to do daily. I like how the app anticipates what logo goes for what task I put in and top of that keeps a record of how many times I have done. It's simple and straightforward, makes it very easy set task. Many complain it needs more than six, but i think it's great that it limits me so I can prioritise on the ones I need to do the most. But for this price, it would be cool if you could add more tasks or be able to set up a task to complete in three days so each day I complete a bit of the task, I can tick off that day of three. Something like that would be awesome!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
