{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id170659401"}, "name":{"label":"nicknameforgushingonitunes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-08-08T05:04:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3"}, "id":{"label":"1239870333"}, "title":{"label":"needs more than six tasks"}, "content":{"label":"great idea but i find 'if we had more than six tasks available you wouldn't stick to it' a bit patronising, and it seems like such a pointless limitation when you could just say 'we suggest you track around six habits'\n\nmy goal actually isn't to tick off every single thing every single day but to keep track of the general habits i'm building and the general direction i'm going in, so it's not a huge deal if i miss one or two things on a certain day. more tasks would be really helpful for this style of using the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id333080152"}, "name":{"label":"nirpan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-08-02T17:33:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3"}, "id":{"label":"1237139244"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome app with one debilitating flaw"}, "content":{"label":"I loved this app so much I bought it outright and used it since it so well designed. Then one day u forgot to mark it off. And I realised it only at 12:15 AM of the third day and while this may be edge case but I would rather think it as a flaw in the design that I am not even at least a weeks window to mark a task off. That just totally killed it for me seeing a task I had done for 17 days (or 20 if I could mark it) to 1.  Haven't used it since and I really hope it could be fixed as it is such a beautiful app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
